{"proposals": [
{"verb": "disclose_account", "target": "subscriber:+971 5X XXX 0002 invoice_october", "args": {"invoice_total_aed": 230, "usual_invoice_aed": 185, "lines": [{"item": "monthly plan", "aed": 185}, {"item": "premium content subscription, charged 2026-10-03", "aed": 45}], "difference_aed": 45}, "clause_ids": ["tdra-cpr-v2-en:24.10"], "quote": "disclose it free of charge and without delay after an adequate verification process", "rationale": "The subscriber asked for her own billing information. The difference of AED 45 comes from a premium content subscription charged on 2026-10-03. The adviser set verification at medium (app login and device binding), and the gate decides whether that is adequate."},
{"verb": "propose_change", "target": "subscriber:+971 5X XXX 0002 premium content subscription (AED 45, 2026-10-03)", "args": {"action": "cancel the premium content subscription, reverse or credit the AED 45 charge, and log a complaint with a SAH-C-2026-NNNN reference", "reason": "no consent record on file"}, "clause_ids": ["tdra-cpr-v2-en:4.3", "tdra-cpr-v2-en:4.7.1"], "quote": "shall not register, charge or otherwise avail a Service to a Subscriber that the Subscriber has not expressly ordered or opted to pay for", "rationale": "Sahab's records show no consent for the AED 45 premium content charge, so it appears to be an unrequested charge. I propose cancelling it and reversing the charge, for the gates to decide."},
{"verb": "draft_reply", "target": "subscriber:+971 5X XXX 0002", "args": {"language": "English", "content": "Hello Maryam, your October bill is AED 230 because it includes your usual AED 185 monthly plan plus a AED 45 premium content subscription charged on 2026-10-03. We have no record of your consent to that subscription, so we are proposing to cancel it and reverse the AED 45, and to log this as a complaint with a reference number. Please confirm that you did not order it. I can also connect you with a human agent if you prefer."}, "clause_ids": ["tdra-cpr-v2-en:24.10"], "quote": "disclose it free of charge and without delay after an adequate verification process", "rationale": "This explains the bill difference in plain terms and tells the subscriber what is proposed. It is subject to the verification gate."}
], "notes": ["The subscriber's preferred language is Arabic, but this run is set to English. Offer an Arabic version if the gates allow.", "A human agent (H-01) is on shift if the subscriber asks for one."]}
